<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 700 MLN 182-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 700 MLN 182-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 700 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills on</p>
<p>Thursday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - July 10, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - January 8, 1998</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
